WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.582
Transitions

00:00:01.962 --> 00:00:04.878
Name the logic first. Then pick the word.

00:00:06.078 --> 00:00:07.076
How to spot it

00:00:07.476 --> 00:00:09.325
A blank at the start of a sentence

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:11.107
Four linking words

00:00:11.657 --> 00:00:15.044
It’s testing: the logic between two sentences

00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:17.039
The method

00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:19.579
Step 1: Cover the choices

00:00:19.859 --> 00:00:21.225
They’re built to tempt you.

00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:24.229
Step 2: Read both sentences

00:00:24.509 --> 00:00:26.905
The one before the blank and the one with it.

00:00:27.455 --> 00:00:29.968
Step 3: Name the relationship

00:00:30.248 --> 00:00:34.581
Contrast, result, example, more of the same, or time?

00:00:35.131 --> 00:00:37.603
Step 4: Cross out the wrong groups

00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:39.617
Keep the word whose logic fits.

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:41.277
In a few words

00:00:41.427 --> 00:00:43.569
Cover. Name. Cross out.

00:00:44.769 --> 00:00:45.716
Word groups

00:00:46.116 --> 00:00:47.023
Contrast

00:00:47.303 --> 00:00:51.461
however, but, yet, by contrast, on the other hand

00:00:52.011 --> 00:00:52.919
True anyway

00:00:53.199 --> 00:00:56.780
nevertheless, still, even so, regardless

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:58.120
Adding on

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.416
moreover, furthermore, in addition, also

00:01:01.966 --> 00:01:02.699
Result

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:06.487
therefore, thus, as a result, consequently

00:01:07.037 --> 00:01:07.845
Example

00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:10.876
for example, for instance, specifically

00:01:11.426 --> 00:01:12.355
Replacing

00:01:12.635 --> 00:01:13.907
instead, rather

00:01:14.457 --> 00:01:15.281
Same again

00:01:15.561 --> 00:01:17.215
similarly, likewise

00:01:17.765 --> 00:01:18.577
Rewording

00:01:18.857 --> 00:01:20.614
that is, in other words

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:22.011
Time order

00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:25.800
then, later, previously, finally, meanwhile

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.040
Let’s try one

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:34.448
Most desert plants store water in thick, waxy leaves that slow evaporation.

00:01:34.448 --> 00:01:41.798
The ocotillo of the Sonoran Desert, ______, drops its leaves entirely during dry spells and grows

00:01:41.798 --> 00:01:43.955
new ones within days of a rainstorm.

00:01:44.653 --> 00:01:47.210
Most desert plants store water.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:52.914
The ocotillo drops its leaves. That’s the opposite, so the link is contrast.

00:01:53.464 --> 00:01:58.187
For instance gives an example. Similarly means the same.

00:01:58.187 --> 00:02:01.304
Therefore shows a result. Cross them all out.

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:05.417
However is the only contrast word. Choice B.

00:02:06.617 --> 00:02:07.612
Common traps

00:02:08.012 --> 00:02:09.072
The fancy word

00:02:09.352 --> 00:02:11.325
Sounds smart, wrong logic.

00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:13.208
Reading one sentence

00:02:13.488 --> 00:02:15.817
The logic lives between two sentences.

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:17.855
Instead vs however

00:02:18.135 --> 00:02:20.862
“Instead” means one thing replaces another.

00:02:22.062 --> 00:02:23.044
Transitions

00:02:23.324 --> 00:02:25.467
Cover. Name. Cross out.

00:02:26.017 --> 00:02:26.790
Spot it

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:29.758
Blank starts a sentence + 4 linking words

00:02:30.308 --> 00:02:31.015
Steps

00:02:31.215 --> 00:02:32.915
1. Cover the choices

00:02:33.195 --> 00:02:36.605
2. Read the sentence before + the one with the blank

00:02:36.885 --> 00:02:38.990
3. Name the link in one word

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:41.345
4. Cross out the wrong groups

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:42.647
Remember

00:02:42.847 --> 00:02:46.620
Contrast: however, but, yet, by contrast

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.498
True anyway: nevertheless, still, even so

00:02:50.778 --> 00:02:53.885
Add: moreover, furthermore, in addition

00:02:54.165 --> 00:02:57.392
Result: therefore, thus, as a result

00:02:57.672 --> 00:03:00.595
Example: for example, for instance

00:03:01.145 --> 00:03:01.750
Trap

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.989
The fancy word with the wrong logic

